                        From finding the right service to taking
                        the next step in your healthcare journey.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="process-grid">


                    <div class="process-card">

                        <span class="process-number">
                            01
                        </span>

                        <div class="process-icon">
                            <img
                                src="/images/services/find.png"
                                alt="Find icon">
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Find
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Explore healthcare specialties and
                            find the service that matches your needs.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div class="process-card">

                        <span class="process-number">
                            02
                        </span>

                        <div class="process-icon">
                            <img
                                src="/images/services/connect.png"
                                alt="Connect icon">
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Connect
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Find healthcare professionals and
                            explore available care options.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div class="process-card">

                        <span class="process-number">
                            03
                        </span>

                        <div class="process-icon">
                            <img
                                src="/images/services/book.png"
                                alt="Booking icon">
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Book
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Take the next step by requesting
                            or booking an appointment.
                        </p>

                    </div>


                    <div class="process-card">

                        <span class="process-number">
                            04
                        </span>

                        <div class="process-icon">
                            <img
                                src="/images/services/care.png"
                                alt="Care icon">
                        </div>

                        <h3>
                            Care
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Continue your healthcare journey
                            with confidence and support.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

